Wait, the crash says "Stack-buffer-overflow READ 11" in `ot::Message::Write` called from `ot::Message::Append` called from `ot::Mle::Mle::AppendResponse`. So 11 bytes are being read. 

Let me look at `Tlv::GetTlv` more carefully."}
